{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "602a1a8f5239413e0edc102ae0795319fc86e46547ae185a8ad281e2d232495c", "ja": "これぞ双子の極意！なのです", "zh": "这正是双胞胎的精髓喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6c2d459068cb4c3045ce81e704954b756ecc9ef974dc00bfc992ab4dc6be57ca", "ja": "第3回を迎えた『お姫様講座』。まつりと\nエミリーの前に、本物の双子である亜美と\n真美が立ちはだかる。一緒にゲームで遊び、\nそのまま解散しかけるが、最終的に『いつも\n一緒にいること』という極意を授かる。", "zh": "『公主讲座』来到第三堂课，亚美和真美\n这对真正的双胞胎挡在茉莉和艾蜜莉面前。\n大家一起玩游戏，并且即将顺势解散时，\n亚美和真美最后传授了她们\n『形影不离』的精髓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "13b12f0e6321bc8e901b70ef96d1fdb37acfa3ebf44e8d48e986676d345a6ee0", "ja": "さて。姫とエミリーちゃんのための『お姫様講座』、\n今日でいよいよ最終回なのです。", "zh": "好的，为了公主和小艾蜜莉举办的『公主讲座』，\n今天终于来到最后一堂的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "f3174d16e81e2a951ffd71431edff2f0b45cc9b728b0e49f7fad3058aea17cb2", "ja": "そうなのですか？　終わると聞くと、\nなんだか、すこしさみしいような……。", "zh": "是吗？听到要结束了，\n总觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "53e03e1a0a5cf278db6fddae64b9e39027315f6554e2638be6d7cd03421c1ace", "ja": "ああ、そうだな……。\nそれで、今日はどんな内容なんだ？", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得……\n那今天的讲座内容是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "48783a6a5cac5729bd9faf38558017d8ad7f6379df2151852931c783f8cba6cf", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さんたら、\nもう忘れてしまったのです？　姫のコンセプトを。", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生真是的，\n你已经忘记公主的概念了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "d065a0f38ba745a360da0aa00fbd6b7b1e5e701c39026cf7ea4244f192db9153", "ja": "『双子のお姫さま』……つまり、双子の極意なのです！\nさっそく、先生のところに行くのです！", "zh": "『双胞胎公主』……也就是双胞胎的精髓呀！\n我们要赶紧去找老师的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "23b5430cc8286457879b75df71173cc93423e43ddfbc27a9e82e75e212eb3cfb", "ja": "んっふっふ……よく来たね、まつり姫！\nそして、なでしこ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼……欢迎你们来，茉莉公主！\n还有大和抚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "6f79090925c5367d0f0f922b38b509bd14102fa78e10103dca8e77f9bed6361c", "ja": "真美たちが特別講師とは、\nいくら兄ちゃんでも想像できなかったっしょー？", "zh": "特别讲师竟然是真美我们，\n这连大哥哥都猜想不到吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce53fa5e8789c2266f8f76a0b8d235ff1a9f04b6ba4dd2aec4d3994cd5322033", "ja": "いや、むしろ他に誰がいるんだって感じだけど……。\nというか、なでしこって？", "zh": "不，我反而觉得没有别人了……\n话说大和抚子是在叫谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf10ae14d5b1118b0a22c6cb6c15d74ad7ee4a21ee4e1acf0807457e2a2ee80e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、知らなかったのですか？\nエミリーちゃんのことなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你不知道吗？\n就是指小艾蜜莉的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "68832ab66e9157eaa06a92166165237a338bf51f9d422bb7eb5e046c0fac6114", "ja": "あの、亜美さん、真美さん。\n今日は、どうぞよろしくお願いしま……。", "zh": "那个，亚美、真美，\n今天请多多指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "f940269f949dadf22c4a0972be31f64d6e2ca0e9bdc99c132e4156ad0d4e0a59", "ja": "シャーラーップ！！", "zh": "Shut up！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "f940269f949dadf22c4a0972be31f64d6e2ca0e9bdc99c132e4156ad0d4e0a59", "ja": "シャーラーップ！！", "zh": "Shut up！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "b6f40260987cd9681e570691d64d0c308bd156ba4fe83c72052668c988115e12", "ja": "ひっ！？", "zh": "咿！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "c284385cb3902c7e0a321c44245542d7128342f0928d33b5a013a10530ca8935", "ja": "亜美たちから、双子のゴクイを学びたいって？\nそうカンタンには、教えないよ！", "zh": "想从亚美我们身上学习双胞胎的精髓？\n才不会随随便便就教给别人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "345f04f44e8e6f9b5a5d6b5872565363b8f952a256de9425b6ec90f49772e065", "ja": "真美たちだって、双子ユニットやりたかったのに……\nタダで教えてほしいなんて、そうは問屋が大根おろし！", "zh": "真美我们也想以双胞胎团体演出的说……\n竟然想白学，做你的夏冬大梦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5d9ade6255d90d4ca5151689c806349f7ca1ffae3b1223057161024d61610706", "ja": "なんだ、ふたりもユニットやりたかったのか？\nじゃあまた今度、考えるから……。", "zh": "什么嘛，你们也想组双人团体？\n那我下次会考虑看看的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "acaeb26dc3dde0030d3a6e90377a70b49c053529f10e0ce54595a4a41f77e0db", "ja": "シャーラーップ！！！", "zh": "Shut up！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "acaeb26dc3dde0030d3a6e90377a70b49c053529f10e0ce54595a4a41f77e0db", "ja": "シャーラーップ！！！", "zh": "Shut up！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1c74405deccdeb0ace6cce47ad357ca005f73755ca52859c637e57f5ceaafac5", "ja": "ひえっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "26b99e9ab022705d3c3c1631388aab07afc5f09678c5d7158b2aba8ef4410c71", "ja": "同情なんかいらないぜ、兄ちゃん！\nアイドルの世界は、チカラこそが全て……。", "zh": "大哥哥，我们不需要同情！\n在偶像的世界，力量就是一切……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "e516da87ad11b2ba76497f490f18bd8d0d271a060f8c5da9ec069690100ae0ab", "ja": "そう……。\nこの世は焼肉定食なのだよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "没错……\n这世界就是烧肉定食喔，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "ea49c401ab7d79b79f075a76b4b58e119354bc514921a876c4d36bc304479386", "ja": "それを言うなら、弱肉強食なのですよ。", "zh": "应该是弱肉强食的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "198ffe81bf6a3902af125d27ae2895f1030c72775253c210dd11ab603b808f5b", "ja": "なでしこ、まつり姫！　亜美たちとゲームで勝負だ！\nふたりが勝てば、双子のゴクイを教えてしんぜよー！", "zh": "大和抚子、茉莉公主！和亚美我们用游戏一决胜负！\n要是你们获胜，就传授你们双胞胎的精髓～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "0a0a2f0793828ea4d5ab3cdce8fd21821a0ff8874194382237f2adb15725e3e4", "ja": "けど真美たちが勝ったら、双子ユニットは\n企画ごと真美たちがいただくかんね！", "zh": "但要是真美我们赢了，\n就要把双胞胎团体这个企划整碗端走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "064318666c8bf0b86dfb7e4c6232abf564fd460aece1c1ad893fc08966e0638e", "ja": "そんな！　私、電子遊戯はあまり得意ではなく……。\nまつりさん、どうしましょう？", "zh": "怎么这样！我不擅长玩电子游戏……\n茉莉，该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "37159351dde7a7f621ff7ad998e72cd2ef53942e51fd3f384ddba697b8773dc7", "ja": "姫たちは、双子の極意を教わらないとなのです。\nあきらめるという選択肢はないのですよ。", "zh": "公主我们一定要学到双胞胎的精髓，\n没有放弃这个选项的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "574fb1f0d0bcf665714e453c894da6edb68d83d790935d91efac7a2d1560f0b4", "ja": "亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃん！\nその勝負、受けて立つのですよ！", "zh": "小亚美、小真美！\n我们接下这份挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "3a1dd0e3ecf148b4495281e731400b9a7c54189b1fa25347cc68e2ffed8245c3", "ja": "んっふっふ～。その意気だよ、まつり姫！　じゃあ\n最初は、この『はらぺこ太郎レーシング』で対戦ね♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～这样就对了，茉莉公主！\n那就先用《肚子饿扁太郎赛车》来对战吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "f27977aa0005c8c4003331acb5354ea2b547086bd16374d186c7af86ce9bf77d", "ja": "それっ！　兄ちゃんにヤキニク攻撃！\nこれでまんぷくゲージがマックス！　とりゃーっ！", "zh": "嘿！对大哥哥使出烧肉攻击！\n这样吃饱饱能量条就满了！看招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4d816a8f47d780b2dc025eb2fd6bf0da166fde55c5c6698086af2415d5d4374b", "ja": "うわーっ！？　コーナーが曲がりきれない！\nくっ、コースアウトしてしまった……。", "zh": "呜哇！？转弯不及！\n唔，脱离赛道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "b7292f902f86bb1eda2e6ffe072fddcecd979f3a1507eefbe7b729514e796f4c", "ja": "よーし、ジャマな兄ちゃんはカタづいたっ！\n真美、次はなでしこを攻撃するよ！", "zh": "好～收拾掉碍事的大哥哥了！\n真美，接下来要攻击大和抚子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "acc8702af47b38d6de28ff7e35b81fd3e7c058e391a3550d9a05c26f28036cb2", "ja": "おっけー！　真美がトンカツ発射するから、\n亜美がゴハンね！　くらえ、カツドン・コンボ！", "zh": "OK～！真美要发射炸猪排了，\n亚美负责白饭！看招，炸猪排Combo！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "7873ca65fc929df1341f463620a09c290d50813e6bdd34b8ba7905e55fdaa2bf", "ja": "きゃあっ！？　まんぷく度数が、\n一気に上がってしまいました……！", "zh": "呀啊！？\n吃饱饱量条一口气上升了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "956cc02ae57893e87736ad7b6a03025139f2cf262c7a46da1e9dd65ac29d005b", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、大丈夫なのです！\n姫が発射するウーロン茶を飲むのです！　はいほー！", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，没事的喔！\n快喝下公主发射的乌龙茶！Hi Ho～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1034_se", "source_sha256": "bd3f8bad2f5a174cb154ce099d503faa6b4d61bfc66d466294399af3e973378e", "ja": "ドッパーーーン！", "zh": "咚啪────！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "61b9c876242d021cb92f0e18dceeb67ccb05d1290a249116cc852b6bfef35e49", "ja": "むむっ……やるね、まつり姫！　こうなったら、\n真美！　ゴッドスイーツアタックをかけるぞ！", "zh": "唔唔……真有一手，茉莉公主！既然这样，\n真美！要使出神仙甜点攻击了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1036_012mam", "source_sha256": "230e3af6e221d41c7a24595759371848bec6462facb9a2ca5f35199f61c46c31", "ja": "え？　真美、スイーツ持ってないよ？", "zh": "咦？真美没有甜点耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "4121be417af4c5a04433a4d2c283b04ceb616eb9217685c9b50dd20ef0723968", "ja": "うあうあ～！？　なんでもってないの！？\n真美のばかばかばか～っ！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～！？为什么没有啊！？\n真美这个笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "1f11725a855e2885863b1a8b7d05a675122c95fed63e2c76b903c114e5cae4ce", "ja": "そんなの、わかるわけないっしょ！？\n亜美のかばかばかば～っ！", "zh": "这真美怎么会知道啊！？\n亚美这个蛋笨蛋笨蛋笨～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "acedeb950208850987666d25311d67d39cf0cc94e5e82aa91879b5db6a6deb05", "ja": "はいほー！　チャンスなのです、エミリーちゃん！\nまつりが盾になるので、一気に行くのですよ！", "zh": "Hi Ho～！机会来了喔，小艾蜜莉！\n茉莉来挡攻击，你要一口气冲过去的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "5cece4ade277c8e5f509d1b2f507396481e5bd3dcfbd42c6aacc4f575cfa8b91", "ja": "は、はい、まつりさん！\n全速前進いたします！　えーいっ！", "zh": "好、好的，茉莉！\n我会全速前进！嘿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "9013dacd8ee45bdca79aac6882ee27a56ea399465760625e967548d392ba54dd", "ja": "あー、楽しかった♪\n遊びすぎて、亜美、お腹がすいてきたよー。", "zh": "啊──好开心♪\n玩得太开心，亚美都肚子饿了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "7d98e148568a553bb4a3659744e5034abba8968bc33aa17c6248c18830f2cfd3", "ja": "んじゃ、真美たちそろそろ帰るね。\nまつり姫、なでしこ、ばいばーい♪", "zh": "那真美我们差不多该回去啰，\n茉莉公主、大和抚子，拜拜～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_1043", "source_sha256": "8710408b729abd8123c46609450ec9831f8dc73cece426b0402c7b79aea0c540", "ja": "ばいば…待て！", "zh": "拜……等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c61f99973ab21ba28cd06952360251adf4e450e7c08acd2e60f6069193cb4155", "ja": "待て待て！　極意はどうしたんだ？　これじゃ、\nただみんなでゲームして遊んだだけじゃないか。", "zh": "等等！那精髓呢？\n这样不是变成大家一起玩游戏而已吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "6141b11704d378274607ad47caecd97c490a8af20e559781f635a03f2acb0e25", "ja": "え？　なんかダメだった？", "zh": "咦？不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2002_032emi", "source_sha256": "5b12c2dcad26de4c77670522b7bb2dc1698b0b88573d46e5451e824c3261525b", "ja": "あ、あのっ！　私とまつりさんが勝てば、\n双子の極意を教えていただけると……！", "zh": "那、那个！要是我和茉莉赢了，\n不是可以学到双胞胎的精髓……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2003_012mam", "source_sha256": "8236f322a1f4d45e1fe3547343c02422e1d6f289515e520a5ceb2d40fba842b6", "ja": "あ～、そんな設定だったっけ？", "zh": "啊～原本有这个设定喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2004_011ami", "source_sha256": "792dcf398595255f87ba333194c87d1dd25dc573514f966f95765ff9ef341bb4", "ja": "ちょっと待って、今考えるから。\nえっと～、ゴクイ、ゴクイ……。", "zh": "等等，亚美现在来想。\n唔～精髓、精髓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2005_012mam", "source_sha256": "067d7c268ae87aefa9442335fe640367085491bec5a3087c3bc4032915409be8", "ja": "兄ちゃん、なんかいいカンジのゴクイない？", "zh": "大哥哥，你有没有什么好精髓？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2006_p", "source_sha256": "bd34281c4f6ede4e499621e440e16d914835b3278c16d214fab400f96bd34275", "ja": "そんなこと言われてもな……。\nまつりとエミリーは、ふたりに聞いてるんだから。", "zh": "问我也没用啊……\n茉莉和艾蜜莉就是要请教你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2007_021mat", "source_sha256": "15ecb9a3e5490cb3df9b3fc752547c939a11d2276aceb8a448ed35a0fa2bb9b6", "ja": "ふたりは、いつも仲良しなのです。\nそれは、どうしてなのです？", "zh": "两位的感情总是很好的呀，\n这是为什么的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2008_011ami", "source_sha256": "60052968d034f66433017b933a8a224496f3bb69f3b8189643f617b742f6116d", "ja": "え、そんなことないよ？\n亜美たちだって、よくケンカするし。", "zh": "咦？没这回事喔！\n亚美我们也常常会吵架。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2009_012mam", "source_sha256": "00f9cad1e8811df20712a38133465f64b1ac00fd5e37392f5bce46dd75d1c1cb", "ja": "そうそう。でも、いつも一緒にいるから、\nそのままだったら、つまんないままだし。", "zh": "对啊对啊，但因为一直待在一起，\n如果一成不变的话会很无聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2010_011ami", "source_sha256": "a18e678d60e66db2384cccffd0e1fc78851eae23d64d6c8ca1085e0eaf5d4064", "ja": "あ、それでいいかも！\n双子のゴクイは、それってコトにしとこっか！", "zh": "啊，这好像不错！\n就把这个当作双胞胎的精髓吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2011_032emi", "source_sha256": "c67fcd09ce0a04237de8a496d275f49b59b7fec3176f0acec4e020ecdfc8afbe", "ja": "つまり……、いつも、一緒にいること。\n……えっ。そ、それが双子の極意なのですか？", "zh": "也就是说……要形影不离。\n……咦？这、这就是双胞胎的精髓吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2012_p", "source_sha256": "23f415fdab76077d500685c0c5c534fc40704449dd3b2fc34ea3614f59133692", "ja": "双子がいつも一緒にいるって、なんだか\n当たり前というか、だいぶ適当な答えっぽいな……。", "zh": "双胞胎如影随形，总觉得很理所当然，\n这回答好像有点随便啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2013_011ami", "source_sha256": "7950c6d0fdfdc70fd2a4936d46837b68f4371b859f49ce177a8271d49d7f34da", "ja": "なにいってんだよ、兄ちゃん。\n当たり前のコトほど、大事なコトはないっぽい。だろ？", "zh": "大哥哥，你在说什么呀？\n越是理所当然的事才越重要，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "163d007d7db1f33b74ec53be9971a377756c74950277aa05abcb5f51c4b7828a", "ja": "それは誰なんだ……？", "zh": "这是在学哪位……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2015_011ami", "source_sha256": "6562ee2a2357e8e490c70d8d7ff04f01e088f265fcad89b76c5e016a38770d96", "ja": "それじゃあまつり姫、なでしこ！\n頑張ってくれたまえ～！", "zh": "那么，茉莉公主、大和抚子！\n诸君勉之～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2016_012mam", "source_sha256": "f675de6d17be7010f751f621f84804808b0c74c561728f5872337e81ffc358b7", "ja": "くれたまえ～！", "zh": "勉之～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2017_032emi", "source_sha256": "56d45eb6c5923ba73b8f17e7423855658927daf10798b96d824d1104d9e60101", "ja": "あ、亜美さん、真美さん！\n……行ってしまわれました。", "zh": "啊，亚美、真美！\n……她们走掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2018_021mat", "source_sha256": "069cc205a4ab5619178c674feaf27be82c50b38a431376a3e6d86f4b510067da", "ja": "ふむふむ……なるほどなのです。\n姫には、とっても参考になったのです。", "zh": "嗯嗯……原来如此的呀。\n对公主来说，很具参考价值的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2019_032emi", "source_sha256": "b63edfc95f3e238ec9693961e4d73174f475c453898d89f0682991e0685f0cc5", "ja": "えっ。\nそ、そうなのですか？　まつりさん。", "zh": "咦？\n是、是这样吗，茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2020_021mat", "source_sha256": "6751037e6fb65bcc04dbdcfbae098de3e460c3c467ec043d1ec1ad26eba20297", "ja": "はいなのです♪\nエミリーちゃん、一緒にがんばりましょー！", "zh": "没错的喔♪\n小艾蜜莉，一起加油吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_04_2021_p", "source_sha256": "547d171898c007688d265ddf010075321e7ed8e25e101c199b5853a3a6650426", "ja": "（亜美と真美に振り回されっぱなしだったような……\nエミリーとまつり、何か掴めたならいいんだけど）", "zh": "（总觉得被亚美和真美耍着玩……\n只希望艾蜜莉和茉莉有掌握到一些东西就好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
